--- !u!114 &1947708798
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1947708797}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 445e13603f407004589a4378f99edb2c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DersNotu
  dersBasligi: "Mod\xFCl 3 | Ders 14 | \xC7arp\u0131\u015Fma Tespiti"
  amac: "Bu sahne dersin sonundaki durumdur. TiklaSec beti\u011Fi Main Camera nesnesine
    eklenmi\u015Ftir. Play tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n ve Game penceresinde nesnelere
    t\u0131klay\u0131n. T\u0131klanan nesne sar\u0131ya boyan\u0131r.\n\n\xDC\xE7
    k\xFC\xE7\xFCk \xF6rnekle \xE7arp\u0131\u015Fma tespitini inceliyoruz. Soldaki
    \xF6rnekte iki k\xFCrenin \xE7arp\u0131\u015Fmas\u0131n\u0131 uzakl\u0131kla,
    ortadaki \xF6rnekte iki kutunun kesi\u015Fimini eksen eksen s\u0131n\u0131yoruz.
    Sa\u011Fdaki \xF6rnekte fare konumundan sahneye bir \u0131\u015F\u0131n g\xF6nderiyor
    ve \u0131\u015F\u0131n\u0131n \xE7arpt\u0131\u011F\u0131 nesneyi se\xE7iyoruz."
  adimlar:
  - "Ders14_Baslangic sahnesini a\xE7\u0131n. Hierarchy'de DaireOrnegi nesnesini
    se\xE7in ve Scene penceresinde F tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n. \xC7emberler ye\u015Fildir.
    Yaz\u0131da uzakl\u0131k 3.5 ve yar\u0131\xE7aplar toplam\u0131 2.5 g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr."
  - "DaireB nesnesini DaireA nesnesine do\u011Fru s\xFCr\xFCkleyin. Uzakl\u0131k
    2.5 de\u011Ferinin alt\u0131na indi\u011Finde \xE7emberler k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131ya
    d\xF6ner. DaireB nesnesinin Scale de\u011Ferini 5, 5, 5 yaparak yar\u0131\xE7ap\u0131n
    etkisini g\xF6r\xFCn. Sonra \xF6l\xE7e\u011Fi 3, 3, 3 yap\u0131n ve k\xFCreyi
    eski yerine al\u0131n."
  - "KutuOrnegi nesnesini se\xE7in ve F tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n. Yaz\u0131da X ekseninde
    ayr\u0131, Y ve Z eksenlerinde \xF6rt\xFC\u015Fme g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr. KutuB nesnesini
    sola s\xFCr\xFCkleyin. X ekseninde de \xF6rt\xFC\u015Fme ba\u015Flad\u0131\u011F\u0131nda
    kutular k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131ya d\xF6ner."
  - "KutuB nesnesinin Position Y de\u011Ferini 4 yap\u0131n. Y ekseninde ayr\u0131ld\u0131klar\u0131
    i\xE7in kesi\u015Fim biter. De\u011Feri yeniden 1 yap\u0131n ve kutuyu eski yerine
    al\u0131n."
  - "KutuA nesnesinin Rotation Y de\u011Ferini 45 yap\u0131n. K\xFCp d\xF6ner ama
    s\u0131n\u0131r kutusu d\xF6nmez, b\xFCy\xFCr. De\u011Feri yeniden 0 yap\u0131n."
  - "Project penceresinde Betikler klas\xF6r\xFCndeki TiklaSec beti\u011Fini a\xE7\u0131n.
    Update fonksiyonunda \u0131\u015F\u0131n\u0131n \xFCretildi\u011Fi ve g\xF6nderildi\u011Fi
    sat\u0131rlar\u0131 bulun."
  - "TiklaSec beti\u011Fini Main Camera nesnesine ekleyin ve Play tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n.
    Game penceresinde sa\u011Fdaki nesnelere t\u0131klay\u0131n. T\u0131klanan nesne
    sar\u0131ya boyan\u0131r. Scene penceresinde g\xF6nderilen \u0131\u015F\u0131n\u0131
    ve y\xFCzey normalini g\xF6r\xFCn."
  - "Zemine, g\xF6ky\xFCz\xFCne ve soldaki k\xFCrelere t\u0131klay\u0131n. Zemin
    se\xE7ildi\u011Finde \xE7arpma noktas\u0131 t\u0131klanan yerin koordinatlar\u0131n\u0131
    verir. Play modundan \xE7\u0131k\u0131n."
  kendinDene:
  - "DaireA nesnesini DaireB nesnesinin tam \xFCst\xFCne, Y ekseninde 3 birim yukar\u0131
    ta\u015F\u0131y\u0131n. \xC7emberler ne renk? Neden?"
  - "SecimOrnegi alt\u0131ndaki Kup nesnesinde Box Collider bile\u015Fenini kapat\u0131n.
    Play modunda k\xFCpe t\u0131klad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131zda ne se\xE7iliyor?"
  - "TiklaSec bile\u015Feninde Menzil de\u011Ferini 5 yap\u0131n. Hangi nesneler
    art\u0131k se\xE7ilemiyor?"
  - "KutuA nesnesini \xFC\xE7 eksende de 45 derece d\xF6nd\xFCr\xFCn. S\u0131n\u0131r
    kutusu k\xFCp\xFCn ka\xE7 kat\u0131 kadar yer kapl\u0131yor?"
